2WDW38rv5h1KvVLvW4Hzl9G2GlQ47W5SRxtL4P9lg8W5x2R255Yffx4W5BGJNn5rr0J1W8D9yJ3=
41ZwPkN3447ZSD0RH7W6qlvCt5MyK13N9bSBpWnwCjQW7Dd3tS8J1DvkV5SY8m31-S1QW8g4qVY=
416BqzN3HgcBSQpVghW3NqRg05BxjBMW4ssv8_7-1sWrW9hY-Jz5LqVnxVVbwDK8jq3chW3w109=
c1q1RQJW55jKBv7H8kFRf8lYR0004" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0=
" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"8cMXsSG9" target=3D"_blank">using sarin in plastic =
bags during a 1995 attack</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">=E2=80=9CI have colleagues here at Public Wor=
ks who go on vacation in Japan and, to the T, every one of them who's come =
back the first thing they say is not, =E2=80=98I just saw beautiful mountai=
ns or went to a tea house,=E2=80=99=E2=80=9D says <strong>Rachel Gordon</st=
rong>, director of policy and communications for the San Francisco Public W=
orks department. =E2=80=9CIt's like, =E2=80=98Oh my God, there's no litter =
on the street, and there are no garbage cans.=E2=80=99=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Nineteen years ago in San Francisco, then-may=
or <strong>Gavin Newsom</strong> took a page from the Tokyo playbook. As pa=
rt of an anti-litter initiative, San Francisco started removing public tras=
h cans, a few hundred at first but eventually more than 33% of the city=E2=
=80=99s total, bringing its number from <strong>~5k to ~3k</strong>.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Residents complained, but Newsom <a href=3D"h=
ttps://d2q-Vf04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVxthC8x5rDDW5W-rG=
p2q7Qm5W2bnPc75J_z10N74Pqvv2_3wqW95jsWP6lZ3nJW630lZC2hSMS3W1ky470200HMGW58C=
_xb8WLVNWW689r6N5TjnFRW1rRvgy1YZ81sVgTJJC7zCqqgW1wsRyl8nMhBYW8h0N3Y7pr4DBVz=
chvW1d_Qr-W87yhLR8z988FW709mKZ4DcJwpN3xh3lhB47NVN63_JbBSQ9d_W79LZYV6MLcs0N7=
DhVrbG2SGLW6vXcxZ1XbpnlW5ZQzpq3xFHPwN5_RzYsdkxDMV_X3yZ99GFsJN88hhRGZ0tVDW51=
PxXc48fh13W759v9z2NR80JN58tRdXpH47JW4Rgfpl8PYzGxW75D8yT7Rdv8cW2ZlXnv6mTJhSN=
2YLpl8hqJHTW7qqhcj8SlSKFN8fr4FkXsd3PW8dXwLQ6rZm0bf3M8PWs04" style=3D"color:=
#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"VAt2yLnO" target=3D"_b=
lank">insisted</a> that having a large quantity of trash cans at regular in=
tervals led to illegal dumping by households and businesses. Fewer trash ca=
ns would discourage this practice, he believed, and allow more space for pe=
destrians with handheld trash.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%"><br>Resident satisfaction with the city=E2=80=
=99s cleanliness has <a href=3D"https://d2q-Vf04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/U=
B+113/d2q-Vf04/VVxthC8x5rDDW5W-rGp2q7Qm5W2bnPc75J_z10N74Pqvb2_3wqW8wLKSR6lZ=
3m9W7Y3rtZ2XvJ3wVWVykh8xbsJqW5D001h84Qw4yN34wkC59W6McW30YV5j6-1nd3W4RZT5H83=
bMVhW4vqJrf4h3VrWN8VYLpDm6R20W6_g8323zW5yvW3vHVY_805KbTVN212C2dzgz3W1HHlXY3=
JvwswW726fnB7-SMQ5W4DHNVT6M1Mn_W5Mhpn155Bh-jW6hZXjy3YR2NsW6SBsfB7Wfkb-W4qnR=
X12VvNm4W5dCV0k5wjSC4W4Z_P9-5GWLPwVtYBvv4yktQnW7_dnj77LGp6BW4FvynK8QqLwBW1P=
7QVD4_w00dW2l1xyq8k3nlmW9kwqtk1rMXMZN2Q8pY7L0hQ5W19HGDs74sxCzf5bT2j804" sty=
le=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"8Pg/mWvT" =
target=3D"_blank">stayed roughly the same</a> in surveys since Newsom=E2=80=
=99s trash can cull, although with grades in the C+ range, San Francisco is=
n=E2=80=99t earning any comparisons to Tokyo.&nbsp;</p></div></div></td></t=
r></tbody></table>
