<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">It=E2=80=99s not an unusual price. Portland=
=E2=80=99s new trash cans cost <strong>~$2k</strong> each. Washington, DC=
=E2=80=99s are <strong>~1.5k</strong>. New York City has started replacing =
its longtime green mesh receptacles with <strong>$1.1k</strong> designer <a=
 href=3D"https://d2q-Vf04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVxthC8x=
5rDDW5W-rGp2q7Qm5W2bnPc75J_z10N74PqtW2_3wqW7Y8-PT6lZ3mwW6sV0Y94JbHwtVq2c1c5=
6d763W7pQ4xp2z6yTZW6z0lgT1JL94MW6wrPh245YmfLW2hfVqG1BGKrcN71dwqc6LZvBW4w6s2=
t2Y_VXsW9b1sjG30wP42W1jn0m23Tl8YJW6R4_GW8hkG6DW3NDSPg3kCzjVW28_Cl_3FC-mHW6w=
lGDT8nb50XW6F8rdk3sXYqXW1Gb5Vz7BR7X0W699VbZ1vl7SjW3T2yXz8j6hcBW3HmcQs42H2r-=
W4VqSTF4p3KQwW4LWzFp32G_pRW8vv2Gp13gVkZW3dMnTy3VTmnqW7Twgpj2-n7xDN4Y8mdR51V=
K6N1vRZ-3Bl4shf94jxV604" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data=
-hs-link-id-v2=3D"fR/OgMYo" target=3D"_blank">Better Bins</a> that cost mor=
e than 2x as much.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">New York City=E2=80=99s Sanitation Department=
 claims the Better Bins are leakproof and rat-resistant. A department spoke=
sperson says they=E2=80=99ll last on the streets longer than the green mesh=
 cans.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">San Francisco tested out a generic $630 wire =
mesh trash can but chose the Slim Silhouette because it found the Silhouett=
e=E2=80=99s opening, with a snorkel design, was better at preventing rummag=
ing and its stainless steel body was easier to maintain. (It also costs les=
s than the current models in use by the Public Works Department.)</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">The eye-popping price of these modern trash c=
ans has little to do with permitting and red tape, <a href=3D"https://d2q-V=
f04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVxthC8x5rDDW5W-rGp2q7Qm5W2bnP=
c75J_z10N74PqtC2_3wqW7lCdLW6lZ3myW3XXDLd4LdD8VN5YZxw874XjFW5R7Gnk8kbR4NW14R=
1q051zC3GN9kGxNLQFFy5W1q236Y6jnqMnW16_rhW90KGMCW1H_jm52kDxkcW8XyFnL5D53l_W2=
xs2Vq4XstnCW7VfKck5RN7t6W8CL59x4HlWBVN85tRB9Bz8cSVx1K6l6gtDSzN1xKK_QLs5xsW7=
Fjqcx1Lz2_DW49tR-J8hGbMZW4Vf-K46Sb3X0N5Pjb5nFnC9vW9cZCJr16g2GXW25FSFv7ndQ1y=
V3Zl8k3G656rVMKvtV7wqPTYVdwxjQ8l5Gw7f6dwDpK04" style=3D"color:#192733" data=
-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"Bz2wSCJB" target=3D"_blank">like st=
ories of $1.7m public toilets</a>. Thoughtful designs are more expensive, a=
nd many cities believe it=E2=80=99s necessary to pay the premium.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%"><span style=3D"color: #222222;">=E2=80=9CIf w=
e could use the $600 baskets, if they did what we needed them to do=E2=80=
=A6 and didn=E2=80=99t become more of a nuisance, we would have bought thos=
e,=E2=80=9D Gordon says. =E2=80=9CThat=E2=80=99s what we were hoping would =
work.=E2=80=9D</span></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">She adds, =E2=80=9CThere=E2=80=99s never goin=
g to be a perfect garbage can.=E2=80=9D</p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></=
table>
