<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">And Danny Sauter, the city=E2=80=99s District=
 3 supervisor, has notched at least one win in his quest toward adding 1.5k=
 new trash cans in his district.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">In the Italian-American North Beach neighborh=
ood, with a bevy of pizza restaurants, residents and businesses complained =
that a single pizza box could back up a trash can because of its awkward sh=
ape and lead people to throw litter on the sidewalk.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">So Sauter found a bespoke solution: two bins =
specially designed for collecting pizza boxes.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:125%">Only 1,498 more trash cans to go.</p></div></=
